---
---
<section class="max-w-[1150px] mx-auto px-4 py-16 dq-reveal" id="comparison">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <div class="text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#ea580c] mb-3">PaaS Paradigm Shift</div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
      Stop fighting infrastructure.<br />
      <span class="text-[#ea580c]">Start shipping instantly.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-[#7f7f8a] max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Dequel replaces fragmented DevOps tools with a unified self-hosted platform.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
    <!-- Left Card: Traditional DevOps -->
    <div class="bg-[#0c0c0e] border border-[#222228] hover:border-[#33333d] rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl">
      <div>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <span class="inline-block bg-[#161619] border border-[#27272a] text-[#a1a1aa] text-[0.65rem] font-mono font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded">
            TRADITIONAL DEVOPS
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8 font-display">
          More tools. More upkeep.
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-[#52525b] font-bold mr-3 select-none">—</span>
            <span>Maintain scripts, manifests, and ingress rules</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-[#52525b] font-bold mr-3 select-none">—</span>
            <span>Renew certificates and route domains by hand</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-[#52525b] font-bold mr-3 select-none">—</span>
            <span>Stitch together logs, metrics, and alerts</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-[#222228] pt-6 text-xs font-mono text-[#52525b]">
        High overhead · Fragmented stack
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Card: With Dequel -->
    <div class="bg-[#0c0c0e] border-2 border-[#ea580c] rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl shadow-orange-950/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-orange-950/40 relative overflow-hidden group">
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-48 h-48 bg-[#ea580c]/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none group-hover:bg-[#ea580c]/20 transition-all duration-500"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <span class="inline-block bg-[#ea580c] text-white text-[0.65rem] font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded">
            WITH DEQUEL
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-8 font-display">
          One command. One platform.
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-[#e4e4e7] leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-[#ea580c] font-bold mr-3 select-none">✓</span>
            <span>Deploy from Git, ZIP, or Docker Compose</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-[#e4e4e7] leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-[#ea580c] font-bold mr-3 select-none">✓</span>
            <span>Automate builds, SSL, routing, and scaling</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start text-sm text-[#e4e4e7] leading-relaxed">
            <span class="text-[#ea580c] font-bold mr-3 select-none">✓</span>
            <span>Keep complete control on your own VPS</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-[#222228] pt-6 text-xs font-mono text-[#71717a]">
        Zero lock-in · 100% owned by you
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
